---

---

<section
  id="inicio"
  class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <!-- Video de fondo con opacidad -->
    <video
      autoplay
      loop
      muted
      playsinline
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20"
    >
      <source src="/videos/hero_video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>

    <!-- Gradientes sobre el video -->
    <div
      class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-32 -mt-32 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-primary/20 blur-3xl opacity-50"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -ml-32 -mb-32 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-accent/20 blur-3xl opacity-50"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <div
      class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-primary mb-8 animate-fade-in-up"
    >
      <span class="text-sm font-medium">Soluciones tecnológicas a medida</span>
    </div>

    <h1
      class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-secondary mb-8 animate-fade-in-up delay-100"
    >
      Transformamos ideas en <br class="hidden md:block" />
      <span
        class="bg-linear-to-r from-primary to-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent"
        >Soluciones Digitales</span
      >
    </h1>

    <p
      class="mt-6 text-xl text-paragraph max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed animate-fade-in-up delay-200"
    >
      Ayudamos a empresas a escalar con tecnología de vanguardia. Desde
      desarrollo web hasta inteligencia artificial, construimos el futuro de tu
      negocio hoy.
    </p>

    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 animate-fade-in-up delay-300"
    >
      <a
        href="#contacto"
        class="px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-white hover:text-primary hover:border-primary border border-transparent transition-all shadow-xl shadow-primary/20 hover:shadow-primary/30 transform hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        Agendar Consulta
      </a>
      <a
        href="#servicios"
        class="px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-white text-secondary border border-field font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-gray-50 hover:border-secondary transition-all shadow-lg shadow-gray-200/50"
      >
        Ver Servicios
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats/Social Proof -->
    <div
      class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 opacity-70"
    >
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">10+</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Proyectos Exitosos</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">98%</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Clientes Satisfechos</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">24/7</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Soporte Técnico</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">5+</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Años de Experiencia</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .animate-fade-in-up {
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }

  .delay-100 {
    animation-delay: 0.1s;
  }
  .delay-200 {
    animation-delay: 0.2s;
  }
  .delay-300 {
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
